  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Salmon Production in Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hesy Aquaculture B.V. will research whether starting up a hatchery for Norwegian salmon in Georgia is a technically and commercially feasible investment. If the investment takes place, this will help develop salmon farming in Georgia, contributing to improved food security and job creation.</narrative>
